    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 28-layer HfO2/SiO2 multilayer coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2 (14 bilayers). Initialize HfO2 layer thicknesses uniformly in range 120-230 nm. Initialize SiO2 layer thicknesses uniformly in range 40-95 nm. Apply gradient-based thickness optimization with objective: maximize mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and maximize mean reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Add regularization penalty proportional to variance of thickness differences between adjacent layers (weight=0.01). Use smatrix solver with unpolarized normal incidence. Total layer count fixed at 28. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
